      "side": "French",
      "summary": "Oudinot's leading division, which found Kulnev's advance guard at Yakubovo on the afternoon of 30 July and fought it all day, pushing it back to the woods until the Russian horse guns stopped the attack. Next morning it took the weight of Wittgenstein's whole corps and was driven back through Klyastitsy over the Nishcha.",
